                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Spellbind was my very first 100% completion on Steam, so it’ll always be a little memorable to me because of that. It’s a short and simple point-and-click puzzle game that’s easy to get through and doesn’t take itself too seriously. The puzzles are straightforward, making it a relaxing game to complete, even if it doesn’t really do anything groundbreaking. Overall, I’d give it around a 6/10, a decent little game that was fun enough for a quick completion.",
